;=======================================================================================
; Vu1Prog25: fog, second colour
;
; gVu1ProgInfo25 (bones.c): 103 pairs (824 bytes), batches of up to 3968 bytes;
; Vu1_SelectProgram's key 0x28000, rigid models (0x21035, 0x121035).
; Setup Vu1Pkt_DV: an UNPACK of 11 qwords to VU 0, then MSCALF 0:
;   0        colour: gGsColorF, RGB scaled by the model's brightness
;   1        second colour: gGsColor2F: vf10
